# Design system

Reuse `apps/web/public/brand/` — do not invent a second logo or mural.

- Cream `#F7F1E3`, apricot `#FF8A4C`, ink `#2A1F18`. Pastels: sky `#7EB8E8`, blush `#F5C4D8`, butter `#F5E27A`.
- Display: Newsreader. UI: Figtree. Sentence case. Pill CTAs, ~48px cards, full-bleed color bands.
- Never use Roots mint `#49E885`, forest `#123F2E`, leaf mascot, or their copy.
- No email capture, no Sign In.
- Hero mural sits behind a cream scrim so type stays readable.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<button className="bg-[#49E885] rounded-md">Get Started</button>

// ✅ GOOD
<Link className="rounded-full bg-apricot text-ink px-6 py-3" href="/labs">
  Open a lab
</Link>
```
